#
# https://help.github.com/articles/dealing-with-line-endings/
#
# Linux start script should use lf
/gradlew        text eol=lf

# These are Windows script files and should use crlf. The CRLF is stored in the
# blob instead of applied by an eol=crlf entry: Nix hashes the working tree for
# `self` but the git blob for an explicit rev, and a entry makes those two
# disagree on narHash, which breaks `nix develop` and direnv here.
*.bat           -text

